BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 597.0 Tm (The conceptual map on the cover is not a literal sector diagram. A forensic parser must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 580.0 Tm (derive actual offsets from the volume BPB, validate both packed-entry arithmetic and all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 563.0 Tm (cluster bounds, and preserve the source medium until independent verification has) Tj ET
